+## Additional Security Recommendations
+
+### MLflow Hardening
+Since MLflow had the most vulnerabilities, additional hardening is recommended:
+
+1. **Network Isolation:**
+   - Run MLflow behind a reverse proxy
+   - Restrict access to trusted networks only
+   - Use firewall rules to limit exposure
+
+2. **Authentication:**
+   - Enable authentication (MLflow 2.0+)
+   - Use strong passwords (minimum 12 characters)
+   - Implement rate limiting
+
+3. **Input Validation:**
+   - Sanitize all user inputs
+   - Validate model artifacts before loading
+   - Use checksums for artifact integrity
+
+4. **Monitoring:**
+   - Log all API access
+   - Monitor for suspicious patterns
+   - Set up alerts for unusual activity
+
+### Model Loading Best Practices
+
+1. **PyTorch:**
+   ```python
+   # Always use weights_only=True (and upgrade to 2.6.0+)
+   torch.load(path, weights_only=True)
